DATA NOTICE

The MIT license above covers the source code of this project only.

It does NOT cover the data file `public/data/motorcycles.json`, nor any data
derived from it. That data is aggregated from user-submitted fuel consumption
records published on xiaoxiongyouhao.com (小熊油耗). All rights in that data
belong to the original platform and its contributors. It is included in this
repository solely for personal, non-commercial visualization and research.

If you fork or redistribute this project, you are responsible for removing
that data file or obtaining the necessary permission from the source.

